  "note": "One card with two scoring zones, the centres of the 10 rings 70 mm left and right of the single aiming mark at the card centre (15.5 mm black, white rings of 5.5 and 10.5 mm, 0.5 mm dot). The card size is the recommended one (minimum 260 mm by 140 mm). Ring values 1 to 9 are printed in the zones. The inner ten is the white 0.5 mm dot, gauged like rings 3 to 10. A 4.5 mm hole is scored with the inward gauge on rings 1 and 2 and the 5.50 mm outward gauge on rings 3 to 10.",
